---
title: "syncLegionAddresses (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_read_registry: read current addresses from addressRegistry
    q_read_registry --> q_update_signer: update authorizedSigner from registry
    q_update_signer --> q_update_fee_receiver: update feeReceiver from registry
    q_update_fee_receiver --> q_update_operators: update legionOperators from registry
    q_update_operators --> q_emit: all addresses synced
    q_emit --> [*]: emit LegionAddressesSynced

    note right of q_read_registry
        INV-001: Addresses pulled from immutable addressRegistry reference
        INV-002: Registry is single source of truth for Legion infrastructure addresses
        INV-003: Callable by anyone (no access control needed - reads from trusted registry)
    end note
